<title>USA: Conn. $100 mln bonds repriced, yields unchanged.</title>
<headline>Conn. $100 mln bonds repriced, yields unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it restructured Connecticut's $100 million bond deal, lowering coupon rates in several maturities but leaving yields unchanged.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:  </p>
<p>STATE OF CONNECTICUT</p>
<p>RE: $100,000,000*</p>
<p>SPECIAL ASSESSMENT SECOND INJURY FUND</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE COUPON CHANGE 2010, 2011 &amp; 2012 ONLY.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA		FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>	     A1 UNDERLYING	  A+ UNDERLYING  AA- UNDERLYING</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 10/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/1998		3,930M    4.25  %	  3.90</p>
<p>01/01/1999		4,880M    4.50  %	  4.20</p>
<p>01/01/2000		5,095M    4.50  %	  4.40</p>
<p>01/01/2001		5,325M    5.00  %	  4.55</p>
<p>01/01/2002		5,595M    5.00  %	  4.65</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>01/01/2003		5,870M    5.50  %	  4.75</p>
<p>01/01/2004		6,195M    5.00  %	  4.85</p>
<p>01/01/2005		6,505M    5.50  %	  4.95</p>
<p>01/01/2006		6,865M    6.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>01/01/2007		7,275M    5.10  %	  5.15</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>01/01/2008		7,645M    5.20  %	  5.25</p>
<p>01/01/2009		8,045M    5.25  %	  5.35</p>
<p>01/01/2010		8,465M    5.20  %	  5.45</p>
<p>01/01/2011		8,915M    5.25  %	  5.50</p>
<p>01/01/2012		9,395M    5.25  %	  5.55</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2006    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 7, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
